  m_Text: 'To improve your gaming experience, we at PapriGames ask your consent to
    use your gaming data. This includes, but is not limited to:


    -Device ID
    (IDFA)

    -Your progress in this game


    This data is collected with GameAnalytics,
    whose developers have commited to information security, privacy and transparency,
    just like we at PapriGames. The data will be used in analytics and marketing
    purposes.


    If you are under 16 years old, please decline this request, or
    ask your parents for consent.


    You can get more information by reading our'
